摘要 / SUMMARY
======================================================================

摘要仅为阅读便利，不构成许可的一部分，也不修改许可。摘要与正文冲突
时，以正文为准。摘要对应版本 1.0；日后正文若有修订，摘要会同步更新。
This summary is for convenience only. It is not part of the license and
does not modify it. If it conflicts with the main text, the main text
prevails. This summary reflects version 1.0.

 1. 这是什么 / What this is
    本许可 = Apache 2.0 全文 + 本人附加条件，因此它不是标准 Apache 2.0，
    不能简称为 "Apache" 或 "Apache-2.0"。Apache 2.0 原文一字未改。它只
    约束本项目的原创部分；第三方组件各按自己的协议，详见第 6 节。
    **它不是开源许可**——开源许可不得限制使用领域，而本许可禁止商用；
    准确名称是"源码可得许可"（source-available）。
    Apache 2.0 plus my added conditions. Not the standard Apache 2.0 and
    must not be called "Apache" or "Apache-2.0" alone. It governs only
    this project's original work; third-party components keep their own
    licenses, as listed in Section 6. **It is NOT an open source license**
    -- open source licenses may not restrict fields of endeavor, whereas
    this one prohibits commercial use. The accurate term is
    "source-available".

 2. 你可以做什么 / You may
    免费使用、学习、修改、再分发（含修改版），用于任何非商业目的；
    也可以向本项目贡献，贡献自动适用同一许可。
    Use, study, modify and redistribute, including modified versions, for
    any non-commercial purpose. Contributions are welcome and are
    automatically licensed on the same terms.

 3. 你不能：商业用途 / You may not -- commercial use
    不得用于任何商业目的：出售、捆绑付费产品、收费托管、付费安装或
    支持、广告变现下载站、嵌入任何商业产品或服务。
    No commercial purpose of any kind: selling, bundling with paid
    products, paid hosting, paid installation or support, ad-monetised
    download portals, inclusion in any commercial offering.

 4. 你不能：只发二进制 / You may not -- closed distribution
    分发编译产物、二进制、打包版时，必须同时免费提供完整可构建源码。
    只发二进制而不给源码，不在本许可授权范围内。
    Shipping compiled, binary or packaged forms without the complete
    Corresponding Source at the same time is outside the grant.

 5. 你必须：再分发时随附修改后内容与改动说明
    You must -- redistribution: modified content and changes
    再分发本作品（无论源码形式还是编译形式）时，必须随该次分发一同
    提供：(a) 修改后的完整内容；(b) 清晰的改动说明——改了什么、基于
    哪个上游版本。二者必须让接收方容易获取：随分发包提供，或在获取
    该分发物的同一页面显著位置直接给出链接。不得要求接收方另行索取、
    注册、付费、等待回复或自行寻找；"应要求提供"或"事后补上"都不算
    满足。仅写"已修改"不构成改动说明。
    Whenever you redistribute this work, in Source or Object form, you
    must ship with that very distribution: (a) the complete modified
    content, and (b) a clear statement of changes -- what you changed and
    which upstream version you based it on. Both must be easy for the
    recipient to obtain: included in the package, or linked prominently on
    the same page from which the distribution is obtained. Recipients must
    not have to ask, register, pay, wait for a reply or hunt elsewhere.
    Providing them only on request, or only afterwards, does not comply.
    "Modified" alone is not a statement of changes.

 6. 你必须：公开仓库，接收方容易获取
    You must -- public repository, easy to obtain
    源码必须通过公开可访问的仓库或 URL 提供，无注册、无付费墙、无时限、
    无访问费，并在分发物及其文档中标注该地址，接收方无需任何中间步骤
    即可取得。
    Source must be at a public URL with no registration, paywall, time
    limit or access fee, and that URL must be stated in the distribution
    and its documentation. Recipients must be able to obtain the source
    from it without any intermediary step.

 7. 你必须：醒目署名 / You must -- prominent attribution
    三处醒目署名：包内 LICENSE/NOTICE、README 等文档、以及用户可见的
    About/Credits 界面；署名须含 "HaoJun0823" 与仓库链接。
    Prominent credit in the package, the docs and any About/Credits
    screen, including "HaoJun0823" and the repository link.

 8. 你不能：抹除署名或冒用名义 / You may not -- credits and name
    不得删除、遮盖或改动任何版权与贡献署名；不得用作者名义暗示背书、
    赞助、关联或责任，不得注册含该名义且易误导的域名或账号。
    Do not remove, obscure or alter any credit. Do not use the author's
    name to imply endorsement, sponsorship, affiliation or
    responsibility, or register misleading domains or accounts.

 9. 附加条款怎么生效 / How the added terms bite
    上述第 3、4 项不是"违反后收回授权"，而是从授权范围中直接排除——
    那些权利从未授予过。因此违反不是违约，而是自始无授权，构成著作权侵权。
    Items 3 and 4 above do not revoke a granted right; they define the
    boundary of the grant. Those rights were never granted, so exercising
    them is unlicensed use, i.e. copyright infringement.

10. 第三方程序（仅当适用）/ Third-party program (only if applicable)
    若本作品修改第三方程序（见附录 A）：未获官方授权，会改动原程序，
    可能与该程序的用户协议冲突，用户自行判断并自担风险；本许可不主张
    原程序任何权利。
    Where the work modifies a third-party program (Appendix A): it is
    unauthorised, it modifies that program, it may conflict with that
    program's own terms, and the user bears the risk. No rights in that
    program are claimed.

11. 免责与作者权利 / Disclaimer and the author's own rights
    按"原样"提供，不担保兼容性、可用性、合法性；不对数据损坏、账号
    处罚、第三方索赔负责。本许可不限制作者本人使用、商业化、重新授权
    或就其作品申请著作权登记。
    Provided "as is" with no warranty of compatibility, fitness or
    legality; no liability for data loss, account penalties or third-party
    claims. Nothing here restricts the author's own use,
    commercialization, relicensing or copyright registration.

