本文件用法 / HOW TO USE THIS FILE
======================================================================

第 0 节至第 8 节为通用正文，用于完全由你本人创作的作品时，单独使用
即可。
Sections 0 through 8 are the general core text. Use them alone for works
that are entirely your own.

附录 A 为可选部分。仅当本作品基于或修改第三方程序（例如游戏汉化、
游戏改造项目）时，填写后一并纳入；不适用时整段删除。
Appendix A is OPTIONAL. Include it, filled in, only when the work is
built on or modifies a third-party program (for example a game
localization or modification project). Delete Appendix A entirely when it
does not apply.

