0. 本许可是什么 / What This License Is
----------------------------------------------------------------------

本许可是 Apache 许可证 2.0 版加上许可人附加条件后的结果。因此它**不是**
Apache 许可证 2.0，不得单独简称为 "Apache"、"Apache 许可证" 或
"Apache-2.0"。它是一项派生许可：Apache 许可证 2.0 为其基础，本文件第 3
节与第 4 节在其之上附加条件。
This license is the Apache License, Version 2.0, with additional
conditions added by the Licensor. It is therefore NOT the Apache License
2.0, and it must not be referred to as "the Apache License", "Apache" or
"Apache-2.0" alone. It is a derived license: the Apache License 2.0 forms
its base, and Sections 3 and 4 of this file add conditions to it.

    SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-HaoJun0823-NCSA-1.0
    基础许可 Base license:      Apache-2.0

基础许可全文：./LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
Full text of the base license:  ./LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
官方来源 Official source:
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Apache 许可证 2.0 全文逐字收录于 ./LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt，本项目未作
任何修改。仅第 3 节与第 4 节为许可人自行添加的条件。
The Apache License 2.0 is reproduced verbatim in ./LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
and is not modified by this project. Only the additional conditions in
Sections 3 and 4 are the Licensor's own.

添加此类附加条件的权利，由 Apache 许可证 2.0 第 4 节末段明文授予：
The right to add such additional conditions is expressly granted by the
Apache License 2.0, Section 4, final paragraph:

    "You may add Your own copyright statement to Your modifications and
    may provide additional or different license terms and conditions for
    use, reproduction, or distribution of Your modifications, or for any
    such Derivative Works as a whole, provided Your use, reproduction, and
    distribution of the Work otherwise complies with the conditions stated
    in this License."

本许可不是开源许可。按开放源代码促进会（OSI）的开源定义，开源许可不得
限制使用领域，而本许可禁止商业用途。因此本作品属于"源码可得"
（source-available）作品，不应被称为"开源软件"、"开源项目"或"开源许可"。
本许可使源码公开、可修改、可再分发，但不授予任何商业使用权。
This license is not an open source license. Under the Open Source
Definition of the Open Source Initiative (OSI), an open source license may
not restrict fields of endeavor, whereas this license prohibits commercial
use. This work is therefore a "source-available" work and must not be
described as "open source software", an "open source project" or an "open
source license". This license makes the source public, modifiable and
redistributable, but grants no commercial rights.

