(a)、(b) 所述权利自始未曾授予。它们位于授予范围之外，因而不存在终止或
撤销的问题。你若行使本许可未授予的权利，即属无授权使用，构成对许可人
著作权的侵害。
The rights described in (a) and (b) are not granted at all. They are
outside the scope of the grant, and no question of termination or
revocation arises in respect of them. If you exercise a right that this
license does not grant, your use is unlicensed and constitutes
