3.1 非商业条件 / Non-Commercial condition
    你不得将本项目或其任何衍生作品用于任何商业目的。"商业目的"指任何
    以获取或指向商业优势、金钱报酬或其他对价为目的或方向的使用，无论
    该对价由你或任何第三方取得。
    You MUST NOT use this project or any derivative of it for any
    Commercial Purpose. "Commercial Purpose" means any use that is
    intended for or directed towards commercial advantage, monetary
    compensation, or other consideration, whether received by you or by
    any third party.

3.2 商业目的——示例 / Commercial Purpose -- examples
    允许，例如：
    Permitted, by way of example:
      * 个人使用与私人修改；
        personal use and private modification;
      * 免费再分发，包括不对访问收费的社区镜像；
        redistribution at no charge, including community mirrors that do
        not monetise access;
      * 自愿捐赠，前提是本项目的获取不以捐赠为条件，且捐赠不带来任何
        额外访问、优先权或功能。
        voluntary donations, provided that access to the project is not
        conditional on donating and that donating confers no additional
        access, priority or features.
    不允许，例如：
    Not permitted, by way of example:
      * 出售本项目或其任何衍生作品；
        selling this project or any derivative of it;
      * 将其与任何付费产品、服务或订阅捆绑；
        bundling it with any paid product, service or subscription;
      * 通过以广告、订阅或付费访问变现下载的站点分发；
        distributing it through portals that monetise downloads through
        advertising, subscription or paid access;
      * 围绕它提供付费的安装、配置或支持服务；
        offering paid installation, configuration or support services
        built around it;
      * 将其作为收费的托管服务或托管服务的一部分提供；
        offering it as, or as part of, a hosted or managed service for a
        fee;
      * 将其并入任何形式的商业产品；
        incorporating it into any commercial offering of any kind;
      * 将其用于生产或交付任何付费产品、服务、出版物或媒体，包括价值
        实质部分来源于它的任何产品或服务。
        using it in the production or delivery of any paid product,
        service, publication or media, including any product or service
        whose value derives in substantial part from it.

3.3 对应源码 / Corresponding Source
    "对应源码"指生成、构建、安装并运行本项目或其任何衍生作品的分发形式
    所需的全部材料，包括但不限于源代码、本地化与翻译数据、生成脚本、
    构建脚本、工具源码、素材源文件，以及用于产出该分发形式的配置。
    "Corresponding Source" means all materials necessary to generate,
    build, install and run the distributed form of this project or of any
    Derivative Work of it, including without limitation source code,
    localization and translation data, generation scripts, build scripts,
    tool sources, asset sources and the configuration used to produce the
    distributed form.

3.4 再分发——修改后内容与改动说明 / Redistribution -- modified content
    你以源码形式或目标形式再分发本项目或其任何衍生作品时，必须随该次
    分发一并提供：
